dslRule:
/*!
@id: eclipse.jface.text.printStackTrace
@description: Replace e.printStackTrace() with System.err.println(e) for cleaner error reporting, especially in example code.
@severity: HINT
*/
$e.printStackTrace() :: instanceof($e, "java.lang.Throwable")
=>
java.lang.System.err.println($e)
;;

